    "theorem": "MumfordFixedGenusAudit.fixed_genus_counterfamily_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem fixed_genus_counterfamily_certificate : (∀ t : ℕ,Nat.card (FamilyField t)=3^(2*t+1) ∧ (curve (FamilyField t)).natDegree=5 ∧ (curve (FamilyField t)).Monic ∧ (curve (FamilyField t)).Separable ∧ Nat.card (Image (coefficientMap t))=8 ∧ Nat.card (cyclic (coefficientMap t))=2 ∧ cyclic (coefficientMap t)=AddSubgroup.zmultiples (imageIso (coefficientMap t) (MumfordCantorAudit.point 1)) ∧ cyclic (coefficientMap t)≠⊤ ∧ addOrderOf (imageIso (coefficientMap t) (MumfordCantorAudit.point 1))=2 ∧ (imageIso (coefficientMap t) (MumfordCantorAudit.point 1)).val.u=X ∧ (imageIso (coefficientMap t) (MumfordCantorAudit.point 1)).val.v=0 ∧ cyclicFraction (coefficientMap t)=1 ∧ ambientFraction (FamilyField t)<1 ∧ cyclicFraction (coefficientMap t)≠ambientFraction (FamilyField t) ∧ ¬Smooth (extend (coefficientMap t) (MumfordCantorAudit.point 7))) ∧ (∀ (t : ℕ) (P Q : Image (coefficientMap t)) (R : Pair (FamilyField t)), ZeroStep P.val Q.val R ↔ R=(P+Q).val) ∧ (∀ B : ℕ,∃ t : ℕ,B < Nat.card (FamilyField t) ∧ cyclicFraction (coefficientMap t)≠ambientFraction (FamilyField t)) ∧ ¬ (∀ t : ℕ,cyclicFraction (coefficientMap t)=ambientFraction (FamilyField t)) ∧ (∀ t : ℕ,Smooth (extend (evenMap t) (MumfordCantorAudit.point 7))) ∧ ¬ (∀ (F : Type) [Field F] [Finite F] (ι : Base →+* F), ¬Smooth (extend ι (MumfordCantorAudit.point 7)))",
    "decl_sha256": "aab1da2ca3a15274aa9e8d2929ef7457ae30d3575155303a06c35fb31e1625a8",
    "scope": "Actual fixed degree5 monic/separable curve polynomial X5-X with reduced-pair genus bound2 over every actual field F_(3^(2t+1)), proved card3^(2t+1) unbounded in t. Actual injective coefficient extension of complete F3 group gives eight-element image group; every sum matches unique actual normalized Cantor gcd/quotient/reduction and full numerator witnesses. Actual proper cyclic subgroup generated by actual pair(X,0), order2/card2, all smooth/fraction1. Full finite ambient universe contains every reduced polynomial pair, not just image list; actual point7=(X2+1,0) stays nonsplit, so ambient fraction<1 and direct unequal fractions/universal negation beyond every field-size bound. Actual even fields F_(3^(2t+2)) split the same quadratic and make point7 smooth, with direct universal negation of nonsmoothness under every finite coefficient extension. No full ambient group/Picard correspondence, large-prime/typical-subgroup asymptotic refutation, uniform limiting-gap or novelty claim. Constant subgroup order2 explicitly retained. No new native experiment.",
